## What It Does

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Auto-highlight** | Runs on every page after full load |
| **Red outline** | `3px solid red` outline + red tint background |
| **MutationObserver** | Catches dynamically rendered Vue/SPA content |
| **Badge** | Small `⚑ highlighted` tag injected into each element |
| **Toggle** | Enable/disable via popup switch |
| **Re-scan** | Force a fresh scan without reloading the page |
| **Counter** | Shows how many elements were found |
| **Persistent state** | Toggle state saved via `chrome.storage.local` |

